WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.549 --> 00:00:04.711 line:3%
  Most of the work on an SPV still  
  happens by hand, in a shared mailbox.  

2
00:00:05.052 --> 00:00:05.649 line:3%
  Payments.  

3
00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:06.567 line:3%
  Passports.  

4
00:00:06.801 --> 00:00:07.527 line:3%
  Tax letters.  

5
00:00:07.697 --> 00:00:08.965 line:3%
  Withdrawals.  

6
00:00:09.264 --> 00:00:11.952 line:3%
  Every one needs the same lookup  
  before anyone can answer.  

7
00:00:12.708 --> 00:00:13.811 line:3%
  Trunks does that first.  

8
00:00:14.168 --> 00:00:16.408 line:3%
  It reads the inbox and never writes to it.  

9
00:00:17.299 --> 00:00:18.814 line:3%
  The reply comes from your records.  

10
00:00:19.156 --> 00:00:20.756 line:3%
  A person checks it and sends it.  

11
00:00:21.791 --> 00:00:23.369 line:3%
  Some emails only look routine.  

12
00:00:23.883 --> 00:00:26.472 line:3%
  A new bank account, from an  
  address that only looks right.  

13
00:00:27.065 --> 00:00:30.371 line:3%
  Fixed rules set out the checks: a  
  call-back and a second person.  

14
00:00:31.471 --> 00:00:32.431 line:3%
  Vegeta.  

15
00:00:33.381 --> 00:00:34.881 line:3%
  More modules on the way.  
